OL,3,GNEWSADrought leaves sports clubs
OL,4,A'praying for rain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeriods of drought and prolonged hot,
OL,7,Fdry weather has had a major effect on
OL,8,Fsports clubs across south-west England,
OL,9,Fwho are feeling the strain.
OL,11,FThe unprecedented weather has left some
OL,12,Fgrass pitches extremely dry and hard
OL,13,Ffor clubs with little to no irrigation,
OL,14,Fwith many dependent on meaningful
OL,15,Frainfall for recovery.
OL,17,FA hosepipe ban was put in force on 9
OL,18,FAugust across Devon, Cornwall and the
OL,19,FIsles of Scilly as the conditions put
OL,20,F"significant pressure" on the regions
OL,21,Fwater supplies.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
