OL,3,GNEWSADrought leaves sports clubs
OL,4,A'praying for rain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water said sports pitches
OL,7,Fand surfaces were "exempt from hosepipe
OL,8,Fbans where watering is necessary", so
OL,9,Flong as it took place outside peak
OL,10,Fhours of 08:00-10:00 BST and
OL,11,F17:00-21:00 BST.
